{# ================================================================= HERO #}
<header class="fg-sec fg-hero" id="top" style="--h:238">
  <img class="fg-bg fg-hero-scene" src="/assets/ttd/bg/hero-scene.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:0;--bh:238">
  <div class="fg-haze" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <h1 class="fg-a fg-h1" style="--x:47;--y:26;--w:320">
    <span class="fg-eyebrow">Anahim Lake <span aria-hidden="true">•</span> West Chilcotin</span>
    <span class="fg-h1-main">There&rsquo;s a<br> lot out here.</span>
  </h1>
  <p class="fg-a fg-lede" style="--x:47;--y:133;--w:270">
    <span>Paddle out from the dock. Watch the pelicans come in.</span>
    <span>Cast a line, find a trail or head farther into the Chilcotin.</span>
    <span>And when the lake freezes, come back and do it all differently.</span>
  </p>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="H6 goose" style="--x:478;--y:40;--w:42;--hh:28"></div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="H6 goose" style="--x:546;--y:16;--w:46;--hh:32"></div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="H4 lodge" style="--x:545;--y:105;--w:170;--hh:80"></div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="H5 dock + boat" style="--x:236;--y:180;--w:145;--hh:42"></div>
</header>

{# ================================================================= 1 · DOCK #}
<section class="fg-sec fg-paper fg-dock" id="dock" style="--h:275" aria-labelledby="h-dock">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/t1-snow.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-45;--bh:70">
  <div class="fg-head fg-a" style="--x:37;--y:-10;--w:200">
    <span class="fg-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
    <h2 class="fg-h2" id="h-dock">Start at<br class="fg-br"> the dock</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="fg-a fg-item fg-canoes" style="--x:20;--y:55;--w:136">
    <span class="fg-slot fg-icon" data-art="C1 canoe" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div>
      <h3 class="fg-h3">Canoes &amp;<br class="fg-br"> pedal boats</h3>
      <p class="fg-p">Grab a paddle and head out from the dock. Canoes and pedal boats are available for guests.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figure class="fg-a fg-print" style="--x:158;--y:40;--w:118;--ph:102;--rot:-3">
    {% photo "dock-canoe.jpg", "A green canoe pulled up on the dock at Eagle's Nest Resort, with Anahim Lake and the far shore behind it.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
  </figure>

  <div class="fg-a fg-item fg-fishing" style="--x:296;--y:45;--w:100">
    <svg class="fg-svgicon" viewBox="0 0 24 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2v18a6 6 0 0 1-12 0v-3l3 3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="14" cy="2.6" r="1.6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>
    <div>
      <h3 class="fg-h3">Fishing</h3>
      <p class="fg-sub">See what&rsquo;s biting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fg-fishbox">
      <h4 class="fg-boxtitle">Anahim Lake fish</h4>
      <ul><li>Rainbow trout</li><li>Cuttbow</li></ul>
      <span class="fg-slot fg-trout" data-art="C2 trout" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p class="fg-regs">Licences, limits and seasons change. Check the <a href="https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/sports-culture/recreation/fishing-hunting/fishing/fishing-regulations" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">B.C. freshwater fishing regulations</a> before you go.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figure class="fg-a fg-print" style="--x:410;--y:40;--w:118;--ph:102;--rot:3.5">
    {% photo "dock.jpg", "The dock at Eagle's Nest Resort reaching out into calm water on Anahim Lake.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
  </figure>

  <div class="fg-a fg-item fg-birds" style="--x:540;--y:55;--w:126">
    <svg class="fg-svgicon fg-binos" viewBox="0 0 32 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 9 8 3h5l1 6M27 9l-3-6h-5l-1 6M14 9h4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="15" r="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/><circle cx="23.5" cy="15" r="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"/></svg>
    <div>
      <h3 class="fg-h3">Bird watching</h3>
      <p class="fg-p">Pelicans on the lake in the warmer months, and birds on the water all summer. Most of it turns up without being looked for.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="C3 bird" style="--x:662;--y:48;--w:55;--hh:40"></div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot fg-margin" data-art="C4 pines" style="--x:0;--y:100;--w:95;--hh:130"></div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot fg-margin" data-art="C5 reeds" style="--x:655;--y:95;--w:74;--hh:85"></div>

  <div class="fg-a fg-around" style="--x:146;--y:200;--w:440">
    <h3 class="fg-h3 fg-around-title">Who&rsquo;s<br class="fg-br"> around?</h3>
    <ul class="fg-species">
      <li><span class="fg-slot" data-art="S1 pelican" aria-hidden="true"></span><h4>American white pelican</h4></li>
      <li><span class="fg-slot" data-art="S2 eagle" aria-hidden="true"></span><h4>Bald eagle</h4></li>
      <li><span class="fg-slot" data-art="S3 osprey" aria-hidden="true"></span><h4>Osprey</h4></li>
      <li><span class="fg-slot" data-art="S4 owl" aria-hidden="true"></span><h4>Great grey owl</h4></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{# ================================================================= 2 · MAP #}
<section class="fg-sec fg-paper fg-mapsec" id="farther" style="--h:225" aria-labelledby="h-farther">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/t2-sage.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-75;--bh:110">
  <div class="fg-head fg-a" style="--x:37;--y:70;--w:175">
    <span class="fg-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
    <h2 class="fg-h2" id="h-farther">Go a little<br class="fg-br"> farther</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="fg-a fg-p" style="--x:75;--y:122;--w:100">Adventure is all around Anahim Lake. Use the map to explore some of our favourite places to go.</p>

  <div class="fg-mapscroll">
    <figure class="fg-a fg-map" style="--x:175;--y:22;--w:435;--hh:205" aria-labelledby="map-cap">
      <img class="fg-mapbase" src="/assets/ttd/bg/map-paper.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="fg-mapdraw" viewBox="0 0 435 210" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
        <path class="fg-road" d="M437 128C405 132 378 150 356 166S300 182 262 182 170 190 120 200 60 206 10 214"/>
        <g transform="translate(372 150)"><path d="M-7-8h14v9c0 5-4 7-7 9-3-2-7-4-7-9z" fill="#F3EEE1" stroke="#1F3327" stroke-width="1"/><text x="0" y="1.5" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" font-family="Oswald,sans-serif" font-weight="600" fill="#1F3327">20</text></g>
      </svg>
      <span class="fg-lakename">Anahim Lake</span>
      <ul class="fg-pins">
        <li style="--px:222;--py:6"><a href="#trail"><span class="fg-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>Rainbow Range</a></li>
        <li style="--px:172;--py:32"><a href="#trail"><span class="fg-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>Tweedsmuir<br>Provincial Park</a></li>
        <li class="fg-pin-up" style="--px:100;--py:68"><a href="#waterfall"><span class="fg-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>Hotnarko<br>Falls</a></li>
        <li class="fg-pin-home" style="--px:40;--py:120"><a href="lodge.html"><span class="fg-slot fg-lodgevig" data-art="M2 lodge" aria-hidden="true"></span>Eagle&rsquo;s Nest<br>Resort</a></li>
        <li style="--px:122;--py:160"><a href="#waterfall"><span class="fg-pin" aria-hidden="true"></span>Hunlen<br>Falls</a></li>
      </ul>
      <figcaption id="map-cap" class="fg-mapcap">Sketch map, not to scale. Ask Diane and Murray for directions.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <svg class="fg-a fg-compass" style="--x:512;--y:62;--w:54" viewBox="-30 -36 60 72" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <circle r="20" fill="none" stroke="#1F3327" stroke-width="1"/><circle r="16" fill="none" stroke="#1F3327" stroke-width=".5"/>
    <path d="M0-30 4-4 30 0 4 4 0 30-4 4-30 0-4-4Z" fill="#F3EEE1" stroke="#1F3327" stroke-width=".9"/>
    <path d="M0-30 4-4 0 0Z M30 0 4 4 0 0Z M0 30-4 4 0 0Z M-30 0-4-4 0 0Z" fill="#1F3327"/>
    <text y="-31.5" text-anchor="middle" font-size="7" font-family="Oswald,sans-serif" font-weight="600" fill="#1F3327">N</text>
  </svg>

  <aside class="fg-a fg-note" style="--x:585;--y:78;--w:120;--rot:1.5" aria-labelledby="h-more">
    <span class="fg-notepin" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <h3 class="fg-notetitle" id="h-more">More to explore</h3>
    <p>Countless trails, valleys and backcountry roads await in every direction.</p>
    <span class="fg-slot fg-notepines" data-art="M3 pines" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </aside>
</section>

{# ================================================================= 3 · WATERFALLS #}
<section class="fg-sec fg-dark fg-falls" id="waterfall" style="--h:190" aria-labelledby="h-falls">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/falls-forest.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-100;--bh:300">
  <div class="fg-head fg-a" style="--x:37;--y:62;--w:150">
    <span class="fg-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
    <h2 class="fg-h2" id="h-falls">Chase a<br class="fg-br"> waterfall</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="fg-a fg-p" style="--x:75;--y:114;--w:100">Scenic drives lead to some incredible places.</p>
  <div class="fg-prints">
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap" style="--x:213;--y:56;--w:122;--ph:84;--rot:-1">
      {% photo "hotnarko-falls.jpg", "Hotnarko Falls dropping through a canyon of dark basalt, with spruce on either side.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">Hotnarko Falls</h3><p>The river drops off the Precipice into a canyon walled in basalt.</p></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap" style="--x:398;--y:62;--w:135;--ph:86;--rot:6">
      {% photo "hunlen-falls.jpg", "Hunlen Falls seen from the air, a single long drop off a forested plateau into the canyon below.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">Hunlen Falls</h3><p>Farther into Tweedsmuir Park, and a longer day than the others.</p></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="F2 moose" style="--x:600;--y:80;--w:75;--hh:70"></div>
</section>

{# ================================================================= 4 · TRAILS #}
<section class="fg-sec fg-trails" id="trail" style="--h:150" aria-labelledby="h-trail">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/trails-bg.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:0;--bh:150">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/t3-pale.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-30;--bh:60">
  <div class="fg-head fg-a" style="--x:35;--y:20;--w:160">
    <span class="fg-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
    <h2 class="fg-h2" id="h-trail">Find a trail</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="fg-a fg-p" style="--x:75;--y:50;--w:92">Hike through forests, valleys and alpine country. Adventure in every direction.</p>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="R2 hiker" style="--x:52;--y:46;--w:56;--hh:52"></div>
  <div class="fg-prints">
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap" style="--x:225;--y:30;--w:122;--ph:80;--rot:-2">
      {% photo "rainbow-range.jpg", "The Rainbow Range at evening, its volcanic slopes streaked orange, gold and rust.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">The Rainbow Range</h3></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap" style="--x:362;--y:28;--w:150;--ph:80;--rot:-1">
      {% photo "beef-trail.jpg", "A rock canyon on the Beef Trail, still green water running between shelves of stone.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">The Beef Trail</h3></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap" style="--x:545;--y:33;--w:125;--ph:78;--rot:1.5">
      {% photo "lake-out-front.jpg", "Anahim Lake from the shore at Eagle's Nest Resort, spruce on the point and the far shore beyond.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">Ask about local trails</h3></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

{# ================================================================= 5 · WINTER #}
<section class="fg-sec fg-winter" id="winter" style="--h:160" aria-labelledby="h-winter">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/winter-bg.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-20;--bh:194">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/t4-ice.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-35;--bh:60">
  <div class="fg-head fg-head-tall fg-a" style="--x:36;--y:24;--w:240">
    <span class="fg-num fg-num-dark" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
    <div>
      <p class="fg-kicker">When the lake freezes&hellip;</p>
      <h2 class="fg-h2 fg-h2-big" id="h-winter">Winter doesn&rsquo;t<br class="fg-br"> shut the place down.</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="fg-a fg-p fg-center" style="--x:100;--y:92;--w:130">A whole new way to experience Anahim Lake and the Chilcotin.</p>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="W2 snowmobile" style="--x:62;--y:105;--w:95;--hh:62"></div>
  <div class="fg-prints">
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap fg-tall" style="--x:268;--y:20;--w:122;--ph:72;--rot:-1.5">
      <div class="fg-tocome" role="img" aria-label="Snowmobile photograph to come"><span>Photo to come</span></div>
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">Snowmobile</h3><p>Miles of backcountry once the snow is down.</p></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap fg-tall" style="--x:408;--y:22;--w:122;--ph:72;--rot:.5">
      {% photo "winter-lodge.jpg", "The lodge seen across the frozen lake in winter, a line of footprints crossing the snow.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">Ice fish</h3><p>Drill a hole, set up and wait it out. Check the ice before you walk on it.</p></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="fg-a fg-print fg-cap fg-tall" style="--x:545;--y:20;--w:132;--ph:72;--rot:1.5">
      {% photo "winter-lake.jpg", "The lodge and its stone garden walls under deep snow, smoke rising from the chimney and the frozen lake beyond.", {widths:[320,640], sizes:ps} %}
      <figcaption><h3 class="fg-caph">Skate the lake</h3><p>When conditions permit, there&rsquo;s nothing quite like skating out on a frozen lake.</p></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

{# ================================================================= 6 · NIGHT #}
<section class="fg-sec fg-night" id="after-dark" style="--h:132" aria-labelledby="h-night">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/night-bg.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:0;--bh:132">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/t5-night.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-58;--bh:70">
  <div class="fg-head fg-head-tall fg-a" style="--x:37;--y:40;--w:150">
    <span class="fg-num fg-num-dark" aria-hidden="true">6</span>
    <div>
      <p class="fg-kicker">After dark</p>
      <h2 class="fg-h2" id="h-night">Look up.</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="fg-a fg-p" style="--x:77;--y:82;--w:96">Out here, the night sky is something else. There aren&rsquo;t many streetlights out here.</p>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="N2 tent" style="--x:530;--y:25;--w:130;--hh:72"></div>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="fire" style="--x:492;--y:72;--w:28;--hh:24"></div>
</section>

{# ================================================================= 7 · CLOSE #}
<section class="fg-sec fg-paper fg-close" id="ask" style="--h:104" aria-labelledby="h-ask">
  <img class="fg-bg" src="/assets/ttd/bg/t6-ragged.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="--t:-13;--bh:30">
  <div class="fg-head fg-a" style="--x:37;--y:18;--w:190">
    <span class="fg-num" aria-hidden="true">7</span>
    <h2 class="fg-h2" id="h-ask">Not sure where<br class="fg-br"> to start?</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="fg-a fg-p fg-p-lg" style="--x:78;--y:60;--w:125">Ask Diane and Murray.<br class="fg-br"> They live here.</p>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="L1 lantern" style="--x:232;--y:6;--w:95;--hh:96"></div>
  <a class="fg-a fg-call" href="tel:+12507423707" style="--x:347;--y:30;--w:93;--hh:55">
    <span class="fg-call-top"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3h4l2 5-2.5 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 6 6L16 13l5 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A17 17 0 0 1 3 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2" fill="currentColor"/></svg>Call us</span>
    <span class="fg-call-num">250-742-3707</span>
  </a>
  <a class="fg-a fg-book" href="booking.html" style="--x:458;--y:30;--w:144;--hh:55">
    <span class="fg-book-top">Book your stay <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></span>
    <span class="fg-book-sub">We&rsquo;ll see you at the lake.</span>
  </a>
  <div class="fg-a fg-slot" data-art="L2 mug" style="--x:620;--y:12;--w:75;--hh:85"></div>
</section>

</main>
